sequenceDiagram
    title UC3 — Bank Account Verification — Full Flow
    participant RNP as Employer HR (Requesting NP)
    participant GW as Beckn Gateway
    participant PNP as Bank Verifier (Provider NP)

    Note over RNP,PNP: Discovery
    RNP->>GW: discover<br/>verificationType = BANK_ACCOUNT
    GW->>PNP: discover
    PNP-->>GW: on_discover<br/>resources[Bank Account Verification]<br/>offers[₹15/req, PT10M SLA]
    GW-->>RNP: on_discover

    Note over RNP,PNP: Selection
    RNP->>GW: select (commitment → Resource + Offer)
    GW->>PNP: select
    PNP-->>GW: on_select (consideration: ₹15)
    GW-->>RNP: on_select

    Note over RNP,PNP: Initialisation
    RNP->>GW: init<br/>subject: Ravi Kumar<br/>account: 12345678901234<br/>IFSC: SBIN0001234<br/>consent: OTP
    GW->>PNP: init
    PNP-->>GW: on_init
    GW-->>RNP: on_init

    Note over RNP,PNP: Confirmation
    RNP->>GW: confirm (contract ACTIVE)
    GW->>PNP: confirm
    PNP-->>GW: on_confirm (performance PENDING)
    GW-->>RNP: on_confirm

    Note over RNP,PNP: Result
    Note right of PNP: NPCI/IMPS penny-drop<br/>Confirms account holder<br/>and account status
    RNP->>GW: status
    GW->>PNP: status
    PNP-->>GW: on_status<br/>VERIFIED<br/>accountHolderName,<br/>accountStatus: ACTIVE
    GW-->>RNP: on_status
